  "executive_briefing": "The digital asset landscape is reaching a critical inflection point as the U.S. Senate prepares for floor votes on the Digital Asset Market CLARITY Act. This pivotal legislation establishes dual SEC/CFTC oversight and statutory asset classifications, unlocking structural confidence across institutional capital markets. Institutional spot Bitcoin ETF adoption has transitioned from rapid initial accumulation into a phase of mature consolidation, prioritizing long-term portfolio integration, risk management, and regulated derivatives. Concurrently, statutory clarity is driving a profound technical shift: native Bitcoin programmability is rapidly advancing as a secure smart contract layer, posing a direct alternative to legacy EVM dominance while non-custodial, trust-minimized cross-chain networks seamlessly bridge liquidity between BTC and Ethereum.",
